<main id="main-content" tabindex="-1">
<section class="hero hero--split hero--page" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="container hero__grid">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow reveal"><span class="eyebrow__dot"></span>Integrations</span>
      <h1 class="hero__title" id="hero-title" data-split>Connect HubSpot to the tools your team <span class="gradient-text">already uses</span></h1>
      <p class="hero__lead reveal" style="--d:3">Our HubSpot integration services start from one rule: an integration that syncs is not the same as an integration you can trust. We design data flows with clear ownership, error logging, and a rollback plan, so when something fails you find out from an alert rather than from a customer.</p>
      <div class="btn-row reveal" style="--d:4">
        <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg js-open-hs-form">Book a free consultation <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
        <a href="#integration-library" class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg">Browse integrations</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="orbit reveal reveal--scale" style="--d:3" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="orbit__ring orbit__ring--2"></div>
      <div class="orbit__ring orbit__ring--1"></div>
